* Physical AI - Experiment 9: scaling network B 2->8->1
* Frozen random weights (seed 9). Weights were not edited.
* Matter Compiler v1 mapping: G=0.001 quant=exact range=unconstrained
* Hidden: precision ReLU. Output: linear.
* Signed weights: G+/G- paths, I_diff = I+ - I- by KCL in SPICE.
* Bias: 1 V reference through G_SCALE*|b| onto the + or - path.
* G_SCALE = 0.001
* shape: 2 -> 8 -> 1

Vin1 in1 0 DC 0
Vin2 in2 0 DC 0
Vref vref 0 DC 1

